{"ref":"BDB, מִצְנֶ֫פֶת²","hw":"מִצְנֶ֫פֶת²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְנֶ֫פֶת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. turban</strong> of high priest;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21:31</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְנָ֑פֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:37\" href=\"/Exodus.28.37\">Ex 28:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:6\" href=\"/Exodus.29.6\">29:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִצְנֶ֫פֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.4\">Lv 16:4</a>;—<em>turban</em> of linen <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:4\" href=\"/Exodus.28.4\">Ex 28:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:37\" href=\"/Exodus.28.37\">37</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:39\" href=\"/Exodus.28.39\">39</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 29:6\" href=\"/Exodus.29.6\">29:6</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:28\" href=\"/Exodus.39.28\">39:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:31\" href=\"/Exodus.39.31\">31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 8:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.8.9\">Lv 8:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 16:4\" href=\"/Leviticus.16.4\">16:4</a>; sign of royalty <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 21:31\" href=\"/Ezekiel.21.31\">Ez 21:31</a>.","next":"BDB, צנק","prev":"BDB, צְנֵפָה"}